			<div class="content" id="post-content-1900141">
									

<p>I didn't like the name, or the fact that it's another memetic language that forces all other languages out and tries to spread itself. I also think you should explain how it's written more clearly. What do you mean &quot;based on astronomical, atomic, and molecular compounds&quot;, anyway? Like H<sub>2</sub>.-He<sub>2</sub>•\C<sub>6</sub>H<sub>12</sub>O<sub>6</sub>? An example might help.</p>
<p>I also didn't like the idea of a much larger scale Foundation, as it feels like an overdone idea too.</p>
<p>Finally, I don't think it makes sense for Foundation-equivalent documentation to be written in a language that causes memetic destruction.</p>

