<p>Not voting yet, want to see if I understand first. Humans were an even <em>worse</em> species at one time, and we've been confined to this world by an alien Foundation, after undergoing certain indoctrination procedures. They're hoping some method (hidden in the untranslated parts) will turn us into a species that can rejoin the galactic commonweal without excessive disruption, but this can only happen if we're not exposed to L-2000, because it undoes their indoctrination and reset us to our basic, unmodified selves.</p>
